sequenceDiagram
    actor Maya
    participant Portal as CMP-001 Portal
    participant Runtime as CMP-003 Agent Runtime
    participant Agent as AGT-001
    participant State as DATA-009 Run State
    participant Gateway as CMP-005 Tool Gateway
    participant Tools as TOOL-001..006
    participant Evidence as CMP-009 Local Evidence

    Maya->>Portal: Submit bounded goal
    Portal->>Runtime: INT-021 run(goal, principal, limits)
    Runtime->>State: create running state
    loop one structured decision per iteration
        Runtime->>Agent: goal + bounded state + model-visible tool view
        Agent-->>Runtime: DATA-042 call_tool / complete / escalate
        alt call_tool
            Runtime->>Gateway: INT-017 trusted principal + typed request
            Gateway->>Tools: validate, authorize, execute
            Tools-->>Gateway: typed result
            Gateway-->>Runtime: DATA-038 result envelope
            Runtime->>State: DATA-043 observation + milestone update
        else complete
            Runtime->>State: evaluate deterministic completion invariants
        else escalate
            Runtime->>State: set escalated terminal state
        end
    end
    Runtime->>Evidence: persist final state/outcome (not audit record)
    Runtime-->>Portal: DATA-044 outcome
    Portal-->>Maya: Unapproved package / escalation reason
